@token = paste-access-token-from-login.rest

### List favorites
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/me/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add (idempotent)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/me/favorites/emerald-satin-maxi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/me/favorites/emerald-satin-maxi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
